{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_title0_en.png?t=1742843759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_field.gif?t=1742843759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory or defeat depends on the placement of your cards, timing of usage, and combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own tactics and unleash unpredictable plays!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_title1_en.png?t=1742843759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_reward.gif?t=1742843759\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_dogam.gif?t=1742843759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the ultimate strategy among over a hundred types of cards! Uncovering unexpected </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">powerful synergies and combos is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_title2_en.png?t=1742843759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546240/extras/steam_shop_dead.gif?t=1742843759\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most important thing in this game is intelligence! Health is intelligence, purchases are </p><p class=